                     <title>Flor. Wigorniensis, etc.</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">At fol. i (flyleaf): 'Md quod ff. Thomas
                        Straynsham deliberauit istum librum fratris Thome Powycke monacho maioris
                        maluernie et ipse deliberauit predicto Thome Straynsham librum uocatum Guido
                        de Bello Troiano anno dom. millesimo cccc octogesimo'. Straynsham was the
                        camerarius at Worcester, 1482--83.</note>
                  </msItem>
               </msContents>
