                  <provenance type="#c"><orgName role="fmo" key="mlgbOrg_601">Worcester,
                        Worcestershire. Benedictine cathedral priory of St Mary the Virgin</orgName><p>There are Worcester marginal annals and flyleaf notes. In
                        addition, this manuscript contains writing in the same hand as appears in
                        Cambridge UL Kk.4.6 and Bodleian, Auct. F.1.9, which is probably that of
                        William of Worcester: for this hand see New Palaeographical Series, 2, pl.
                        87b.</p></provenance>
                  <provenance type="MLGB3_laterOwners">Given to Corpus Christi College by Henry
                     Parry, 1618.</provenance>
